{
  "name": "inbox-det (inbox page, operator + builder, seeded activity + notifications; pending in-memory set empty at cold boot so pending reduced to empty state, merged decision history asserted)",
  "stopOnError": false,
  "notes": [
    "Every activity filter has seeded rows, so the empty state and the error box are provoked through stubInvoke on list_runtime_activity (a once-reject for inbox-error-details-toggle and inbox-error-retry, a once-resolve [] for inbox-activity-empty-cta); switching to the pending tab and back re-runs loadActivity. A standalone inbox-empty-det book with a seed overlay was therefore not created: the anchor is played here inside master-det, and the CTA's only effect is a navigation to observability, undone by the goto."
  ],
  "dynamicTestids": [
    "inbox-activity-filter-all",
    "inbox-activity-filter-degradations",
    "inbox-activity-filter-failures",
    "inbox-activity-filter-llm",
    "inbox-filter-all",
    "inbox-filter-approval",
    "inbox-filter-ask_user",
    "inbox-tab-activity",
    "inbox-tab-notifications",
    "inbox-tab-pending",
    "sidebar-mode-option-builder",
    "sidebar-mode-option-operator"
  ],
